  reportName: "Report 02 \u2014 Navigation Log"
  reportDescription: "The Aletheia station was launched with a projected flight duration
    of 96 Earth years.\r\n According to archives, the navigation system stopped responding
    632 days ago.\r\nCurrent position: unknown.\r\nRemaining travel time: impossible
    to calculate.\r\n Black box records indicate a failure in the central navigation
    matrix.\r\n Recommended action: restart the system manually from the captain\u2019s
    bridge."
